  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And ælc mynetére þe man tihð þæt fals feoh sloge, syððan hit forboden wæs, gange to þrimfealdan ordale; gif he ful beo, slea hine man.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And every moneyer who is accused of striking false coins, after it was forbidden, shall go to the triple ordeal; if he is guilty, he shall be slain.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et omnis monetarius qui accusabitur, quod falsum fecit, postquam interdictum fuit, adeat triplex ordalium; si culpabilis sit, occidatur.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
